{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Halite Warriors vs. The Snail</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's called A Snail's Tale - that might lead you to believe that the snail is the main character, but nay, friend. The player takes control of Samson Spligglebarp, the noble descendant of a famed historian who is eager to make his own mark on the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samson travels to the Halite Kingdom to enter King Phillippe's challenge, competing against other adventurers for a chance to be a Halite Warrior. The King reveals that he is eternally pursued by an immortal snail who will never rest until he is destroyed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so begins the quest of Samson and his intrepid companions, the Halite Warriors, to gather the three Crystals of Power and stop the snail before he catches the King.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/2251b815cd32f82743f9c4010b340fdf.avif?t=1771556016\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/0ce0a45838376132d6c2f6a66731f33c.avif?t=1771556016\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/10ce731543b723645208433937f009af.avif?t=1771556016\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/b71b4466ae4df78c08a5af3eb5b06e9a.avif?t=1771556016\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/0274f07a45fb96c829fd805f7f6b1907.avif?t=1771556016\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/5cb6f5fda27433ab82f2fdb6648bbcb9.avif?t=1771556016\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A retro jRPG mixed with elements of cozy games. Strategic turn based combat is mixed with an idle quest system, minigames, and a world equal parts funny and mysterious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Class system with wacky choices such as the Codwalloper who attacks with dead fish, Souschef who cooks enemies to turn them into items, the survivalist Scrounger, a parlor magician Rinkydink, and an essential oils salesperson known as the Oilist. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other features include an obligatory fishing minigame, two player local co-op in battles, dojo battle gauntlets, and more!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2944770?t=1771556016","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2944770?t=1771556016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/5b6cfa8dbccb85477df520b7a177633ea097b488/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771556016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/5b6cfa8dbccb85477df520b7a177633ea097b488/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771556016","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4285650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Halite Warriors vs. The Snail</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's called A Snail's Tale - that might lead you to believe that the snail is the main character, but nay, friend. The player takes control of Samson Spligglebarp, the noble descendant of a famed historian who is eager to make his own mark on the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samson travels to the Halite Kingdom to enter King Phillippe's challenge, competing against other adventurers for a chance to be a Halite Warrior. The King reveals that he is eternally pursued by an immortal snail who will never rest until he is destroyed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so begins the quest of Samson and his intrepid companions, the Halite Warriors, to gather the three Crystals of Power and stop the snail before he catches the King.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/2251b815cd32f82743f9c4010b340fdf.avif?t=1771556016\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/0ce0a45838376132d6c2f6a66731f33c.avif?t=1771556016\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/10ce731543b723645208433937f009af.avif?t=1771556016\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/b71b4466ae4df78c08a5af3eb5b06e9a.avif?t=1771556016\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/0274f07a45fb96c829fd805f7f6b1907.avif?t=1771556016\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/5cb6f5fda27433ab82f2fdb6648bbcb9.avif?t=1771556016\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A retro jRPG mixed with elements of cozy games. Strategic turn based combat is mixed with an idle quest system, minigames, and a world equal parts funny and mysterious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Class system with wacky choices such as the Codwalloper who attacks with dead fish, Souschef who cooks enemies to turn them into items, the survivalist Scrounger, a parlor magician Rinkydink, and an essential oils salesperson known as the Oilist. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other features include an obligatory fishing minigame, two player local co-op in battles, dojo battle gauntlets, and more!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Retreaux Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/163dec34888e7ff0418b13181ed4cdbaf9bab18d/header.jpg?t=1771556016","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2944770/1760198297/20838ae0cb8e2270669e21cd85512fbe846f4278/1771555201/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771556015","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2944770/1760198297/20838ae0cb8e2270669e21cd85512fbe846f4278/1771555201/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771556015","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2944770/1760198297/20838ae0cb8e2270669e21cd85512fbe846f4278/1771555201/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771556015","id":257290734,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257290734/00fc32a99cc9463330a0ee97d4ddbdd3f12a7151/movie_600x337.jpg?t